+-++        [M1120-INFO] operation mode was chnaged to OPERATION_MODE_{MEASUREMENT,
+-++                     POWERDOWN,FUSEROMACCESS}
+-++        "wait 5ms after vdd power up"  /  "sw-reset was failed"
+-++-input: up-mxm1120 / down-mxm1120
+-++ ```
