+-+- 恢复：霍尔核心 misc ioctl（@0x8aae808 分支）读同一个文件、`sscanf(buf,"%u-%u",…)`，然后调用**导出函数** `set_vib_up_down_count(int up, int down)` @0x8aa9980 → `h->up_down_count = up; h->all_count = down;`。
