+-++### I2C 协议
+-++
+-++```
+-++写： buf[0]=reg, buf[1]=value，单条 i2c_msg，i2c_transfer(adapter, &msg, 1)
+-++读： i2c_smbus_read_i2c_block_data(client, reg, len, buf)
