+-++> **重要缺陷**：`devm_kmalloc`（非 `kzalloc`）分配 680 字节，因此
+-++> `enable(0x19C)`、`target_state(0x1A4)`、`holder_mode(0x1B0)`、`all_count(0x2A4)`、`notify_str(0x1B8..)`
