+--diff --git a/s6patch霍尔/0007-docs-Add-the-full-vib_pwm-and-bbk_hall_core-reverse-.patch b/s6patch霍尔/0007-docs-Add-the-full-vib_pwm-and-bbk_hall_core-reverse-.patch
