+--+```
+--+ioctl: M1120_IOCTL_{GET,SET}_REG / _ENABLE / _DELAY / _INTERRUPT /
+--+       GET_CALIBRATED_DATA / SET_CALIBRATION
+--+日志:  [M1120-DBG] reg.map.intsrs = 0x%02X / threshold : (0x%02X%02X, 0x%02X%02X)
