+++++---------ioctl: BBK_HALL_CORE_IOCTL_SET_MHALL_CALI_DAEMON -------
+++++---------ioctl: BBK_HALL_CORE_IOCTL_SET_CALI after Hall Cali-------
+++++---------ioctl: BBK_HALL_CORE_IOCTL_SET_MHALL_CALI after Hall Cali-------
