+diff --git a/patch_final/per-commit/0046-ASoC-aw882xx-Start-the-amplifier-when-the-ROM-ships-.patch b/patch_final/per-commit/0046-ASoC-aw882xx-Start-the-amplifier-when-the-ROM-ships-.patch
