+++Subject: [PATCH 02/40] module: Accept vendor DLKM signature and symbol CRC
+++ mismatches
+++
+++The vendor modules in /vendor/lib/modules are built from the complete vendor
+++tree together with the shipping kernel, so a kernel built from this tree cannot
+++match their signature or their symbol CRCs (module_layout: vendor 0xcc8cac52,
