++-+### 3.2 `/mnt/vendor/persist/sensors/cali_mhall_final` —— 48 字节（`g_mhall_cali_data`，`0x9f75648`）
++-+
++-+由 `init_hall_data_fake`（`0x8aa9710`）与 `vib_pwm_elevator_row_shift_show`（`0x8aac1a8`）反推：
